  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add tomato and cook for 2 minutes, until heated through.",
    "Add yellow split peas, chicken broth, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 15 minutes.",
    "Stir in parmesan cheese and cook for 1-2 minutes, until melted and bubbly.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley."
